                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "A track's config panel, reached from the chevron zone of its row on readout-volumes; full-screen per the 7\u2033 discipline. RC-20 drawn. Contents: the track's volume (ThalA-scaled slider, dB), MUTE and FX CHAIN as big 110-high toggles (same on\/off vocabulary as the input panel), and its INPUT source as a read-only $bg-control pill (routing is edited on the main screen). BACK chip returns to the volume list; the 8 s inactivity auto-revert chain applies (panel \u2192 list \u2192 readout)."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
